# PHANTOM

### Evidence-Driven Threat Actor Attribution

PHANTOM is an **evidence-driven threat intelligence and investigation platform** that correlates fragmented digital observations across underground ecosystems to generate **explainable threat-actor attribution hypotheses**.

Developed for **Smart India Hackathon 2026** under the problem statement **SIH26151 — Dark-Web Threat Actor De-anonymization**.

---

## Smart India Hackathon 2026

- **Problem Statement:** SIH26151 — Dark-Web Threat Actor De-anonymization
- **Theme:** Blockchain & Cybersecurity
- **Category:** Software
- **Team:** TEAM PHANTOM

The project focuses on the challenge of correlating fragmented observations such as aliases, cryptocurrency wallets, PGP identifiers, infrastructure, behavioural patterns and temporal activity into persistent, evidence-backed attribution hypotheses.

